# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP Servers {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit MCP Servers is a collection of [Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) servers that integrate quantum "
"computing capabilities into AI systems. These servers enable AI assistants, "
"large language models (LLMs), and agents to access IBM Quantum&reg; services"
" and Qiskit libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit MCP Servers adalah kumpulan server [Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) yang mengintegrasikan kemampuan "
"komputasi kuantum ke dalam sistem AI. Server-server ini memungkinkan asisten"
" AI, large language model (LLM), dan agen untuk mengakses layanan IBM "
"Quantum&reg; dan library Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an open-source project. For the most up-to-date information, detailed API coverage, and advanced configurations, refer to the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ini adalah proyek open-source. Untuk informasi terbaru, cakupan API lengkap, dan konfigurasi lanjutan, lihat [repositori GitHub Qiskit MCP Servers](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

